# Wesnoth Access end-to-end test: start "A Tale of Two Brothers" from the main
# menu using only the keyboard, read the story and the dialogue, reach the
# first turn, read the objectives, save the game.
#ARGS:

wait-dialog 240000 title_screen
expect Campaigns, button

# Enter on the focused Campaigns button opens the campaign selection.
mark
key Enter
wait-dialog 60000 campaign_selection
expect Battle Training
mark
key Down
expect A Tale of Two Brothers
expect An evil mage
# The sort toggles are named as sort buttons and the modifications menu by
# its label, not by its value.
mark
key F4
expect Name, sort button
expect Modifications, multi select menu

# Enter starts the selected campaign.
mark
key Enter
wait-dialog 120000 story_viewer
wait-for 20000 Maghre
expect next, button

# Enter presses "next": the next story page is read automatically.
# (While a page is still fading in, the game's first press only completes the fade.)
wait 4000
mark
key Enter
wait 3000
expect dark mage
# The new page is spoken once, not twice.
expect-once settled in the region
# F11 repeats the last story text from the dialogue history.
mark
key F11
expect Dialogue
expect dark mage
# Escape skips the rest of the story; the scenario starts with dialogue.
key Escape
wait-dialog 60000 wml_message_left
wait-for 10000 Greetings, brother
mark
key F4
expect Baran

# Enter dismisses each message; the dialogue history keeps them.
press-until 120000 Enter Your turn
mark
key Shift+F11
expect Dialogue

# Close the objectives popup if it is shown, then read objectives and economy.
wait 2000
key Escape
wait 1000
mark
key F8
expect Objectives
expect Mordak
mark
key F9
expect Turn 1

# Save the game with the native dialog (Ctrl+S, Enter).
mark
key Ctrl+S
wait-dialog 15000 game_save
expect Save
key Enter
wait-for 15000 has been saved
key Enter
wait 1500

# Load it again with the native dialog (Ctrl+O): the list of saves is read.
mark
key Ctrl+O
wait-dialog 15000 game_load
expect Load
expect Rooting Out a Mage
mark
key Enter
wait-for 120000 Your turn
expect Turn 1 of 18

quit
